# Delivery skills

Cursor loads the shared skills from `.agents/skills/`. Use them by
name. Source: `agents_extensions/cursor/rules/delivery-skills.md`.

- `full-send` — deliver a change to MERGED and closeout. Only the accountable driver of the
  PR's stream, the integration owner or the CTO.
- `full-stop` — deliver to ready-to-merge and never merge. Anyone, including workers.
- `review-loop` — review rounds and the budget to a recorded verdict. The driver runs it; a
  worker asks its driver.
- `takeover`, `modernize` — entry skills that end in a hand-off record for `full-send` or
  `full-stop`. A worker never closes, merges or enqueues, even with authorization; only the
  accountable driver, the integration owner or the CTO does.
- `pr-comments` — every agent comment on GitHub.

A worker seat never merges, enqueues, arms auto-merge or dispatches reviewers. The skills never
override the repository rules or the operator-only list.
